# Timestamp offsets: when the interleaver starts it subtracts the first VIDEO PTS from video dts/pts, and the first
# AUDIO DTS (only if > 0) from audio dts/pts. B-frame style video (dts < pts) therefore gets a negative dts.
video 30 1 1280 720
audio 48000
venc v
aenc a frame_size=1024
out o av,encoded autobegin=1
set_venc o v
set_aenc o a
start o
echo --- video starts at pts 10, dts 8 (2 frames reorder delay); audio dts 5000
emit a 5000 5000 0 4
emit a 6024 6024 0 4
emit a 7048 7048 0 4
emit v 10 8 1 4
state o
emit v 11 9 0 4
emit a 8072 8072 0 4
emit v 12 10 0 4
emit a 9096 9096 0 4
stop o
